flowchart TB
  PURPOSE["목적<br/>baseline보다 검색 품질이 높고<br/>더 효율적인 RAG 구조 탐색"]
  BASE["Immutable local baseline control<br/>KURE page-only Dense · fixed local generator<br/>재현/rollback 유지"]

  subgraph SOURCES["Challenger hypothesis"]
    GPT["GPT retrieval research<br/>hybrid · parent-child · reranker · visual"]
    EVO["EvoHarness research<br/>evidence state · verify · bounded loop"]
    TEAM["HB/DH experiments<br/>KURE · Kiwi · router · analytics"]
  end

  ISO["local-first 격리 구현<br/>versioned config + immutable artifacts<br/>generator adapter는 local/API 교체형"]
  ABL["Component ablation<br/>parser → chunk → embedder → fusion<br/>reranker → Harness"]
  ASM["Assembled challenger<br/>BidFit Evidence-Harness v1-rc0"]
  GOLD["동일 frozen golden A/B<br/>같은 corpus · qrels · judge · scope · budget · order"]

  subgraph METRICS["독립 측정"]
    Q["검색 품질<br/>Recall · MRR · nDCG<br/>doc/page/object/set completeness"]
    E["효율<br/>build/query p50·p95<br/>RAM·VRAM · index · token·cost"]
    S["Guardrail<br/>citation · abstention<br/>error · regression"]
  end

  DEC{"사전 동결 gate / Pareto 판정"}
  WIN["WIN<br/>local-first 기본 profile로 채택<br/>baseline rollback 유지"]
  MIX["MIXED<br/>가장 단순한 Pareto 후보 선택<br/>또는 추가 한 축 실험"]
  LOSE["LOSS / regression<br/>baseline 유지<br/>실패 원인만 다음 가설로"]

  PURPOSE --> BASE
  PURPOSE --> GPT
  PURPOSE --> EVO
  PURPOSE --> TEAM
  GPT --> ISO
  EVO --> ISO
  TEAM --> ISO
  ISO --> ABL --> ASM
  BASE --> GOLD
  ASM --> GOLD
  GOLD --> Q
  GOLD --> E
  GOLD --> S
  Q --> DEC
  E --> DEC
  S --> DEC
  DEC -->|"gate 충족"| WIN
  DEC -->|"trade-off"| MIX
  DEC -->|"미달"| LOSE
  MIX -. "새 가설" .-> ABL
  LOSE -. "실패 유형" .-> ABL

  classDef green fill:#e8f2ea,stroke:#8eb49a,color:#1f2933,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef blue fill:#e8f0f7,stroke:#8fb4cf,color:#1f2933,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef amber fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#d8aa53,color:#1f2933,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef red fill:#fde9e6,stroke:#d98e84,color:#1f2933,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef gray fill:#eef1ed,stroke:#aab5ad,color:#1f2933,stroke-width:1.5px
  class WIN green
  class ISO,ABL,ASM blue
  class GPT,EVO,TEAM,DEC,MIX amber
  class PURPOSE,BASE,GOLD,Q,E,S gray
  class LOSE red
